Hi {Owner},

I build websites for dance studios around {City}. {Business Name} shares lovely recital and class posts on its social pages, but there's no site where a new parent can see classes by age and register.

I built a sample first rather than ask for your time: ballet, tap, jazz and hip hop by age and level, a dancewear list for each class, a recital hub and online registration, with marked placeholders where your photos would go:

{demo-link}

If you want it, I move it to a domain you own and finish it for {Build Range}, plus {Care Range} a month for hosting and season changes. If not, no problem, it comes down at the end of the month.

Worth ten minutes on the phone before the studio opens one day?

{Your Name}
{Your Studio} · {Your Phone}
{Your Physical Address}

